    </ThingDef>

	<ThingDef ParentName="ApparelTorsoMBase">
        <defName>NunB</defName>
        <label>Nun - Torso B</label>
        <description>Part of the Nun Series. An religious dress appropriate for most situations. Beside are leg windows that allow an extra range of motion. Wearing this outfit gives the wearer an ambience of faith and holiness, allowing her to suppress different kinds of evil.</description>
        <graphicData>
